      "count": 17,
      "tests": [
        "a text-only memory is created by its author",
        "a preset photo listed in preset_assets/photos is allowed",
        "a photo that is not a listed preset (device path, unlisted or public link) is refused",
        "public links, Cloudinary storage flags and local video URIs are never stored",
        "a publicId with an active asset owned by the author in this couple is allowed",
        "a video memory is allowed when its confirmed asset is a video",
        "a publicId without a confirmed active asset is refused (none, reserved, deleting, expired, deleted)",
        "a publicId whose asset was uploaded by the partner, or belongs to another couple, is refused",
        "a publicId that is not inlove_mem_<this memory id> is refused, even with a matching asset",
        "authorId must be the caller, and a stranger cannot create a memory",
        "an update cannot attach a file to a memory that has none",
        "the partner can edit the text and keep the file, but cannot change the author",
        "an update may clear the file",
        "a legacy memory that still holds a public link cannot be rewritten until it is migrated",
        "a stranger cannot read or write media memories, and nobody writes to a terminated couple",
        "clients can never read or write media bookkeeping (mediaAssets, mediaQuota)",
        "the legacy top-level memories collection accepts no new rows; the author can delete their own"
      ]
    },
